    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Reproduces a historical bug where, after a {@link FilterListIterator} had been walked all the way forward, a call to {@code hasNext()} could corrupt the iterator's state so that the following {@code previous()} returned the wrong element. <p>The iterator under test filters the numbers {@code 0..19} down to the multiples of four ({@code 0, 4, 8, 12, 16}). A plain {@link ListIterator} over the expected multiples of four serves as the reference for the assertions.</p>"
